  description: '"Infernoid" monsters you control whose original Levels are 2 or higher
    become Level 1 and all battle damage they inflict to your opponent is halved.
    You can send this card to the Graveyard; Fusion Summon 1 "Infernoid" Fusion Monster
    from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or your side of the field
    as Fusion Materials. If your opponent controls a monster that was Special Summoned
    from the Extra Deck, and you do not, you can also use up to 6 monsters in your
    Deck as Fusion Materials.'
